  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "During your Command phase, you may pick one Combat Doctrine ability; every **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** unit of yours has it until your next Command phase starts. Each can be picked once per battle.\n\n- **Assault Doctrine**: the unit may still declare a charge after Advancing that turn.\n- **Devastator Doctrine**: the unit may still shoot after Advancing that turn.\n- **Tactical Doctrine**: the unit may still shoot, and may still declare a charge, after Falling Back that turn.",
